vg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check w-2.5 h-2.5"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span><span class="text-lg leading-none">🤝</span><span class="text-[9.5px] font-semibold leading-none text-foreground">Relações</span></div><div data-testid="tile-incluso" class="relative rounded-2xl border-2 px-1 pt-2 pb-1.5 flex flex-col items-center gap-1 bg-card border-border"><span aria-label="incluso" class="absolute -top-1.5 -right-1.5 w-4 h-4 rounded-full grid place-items-center text-white border-2 border-white" style="background: rgb(31, 157, 106);"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check w-2.5 h-2.5"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span><span class="text-lg leading-none">🐶</span><span class="text-[9.5px] font-semibold leading-none text-foreground">Pet</span></div><div data-testid="tile-incluso" class="relative rounded-2xl border-2 px-1 pt-2 pb-1.5 flex flex-col items-center gap-1 bg-card border-border"><span aria-label="incluso" class="absolute -top-1.5 -right-1.5 w-4 h-4 rounded-full grid place-items-center text-white border-2 border-white" style="background: rgb(31, 157, 106);"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check w-2.5 h-2.5"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span><span class="text-lg leading-none">🚭</span><span class="text-[9.5px] font-semibold leading-none text-foreground">Detox</span></div></div></div><p class="text-[12.5px] leading-snug mt-3"><strong>Você escolheu por onde começar.</strong> Leva os 16 — no mesmo pagamento, sem nada cobrado à parte.</p></div></div><div style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-4"><div class="grid grid-cols-2 divide-x divide-border"><div class="pr-3 text-center"><p class="text-[11px] text-muted-foreground leading-tight mb-1">Somem por ano,<br>pela sua estimativa</p><p class="text-xl font-extrabold text-destructive/80 tracking-tight">R$ 6.000</p></div><div class="pl-3 text-center"><p class="text-[11px] text-muted-foreground leading-tight mb-1">CORE completo,<br>pra enxergar tudo</p><p class="text-xl font-extrabold text-accent tracking-tight">R$ 27,90<span class="block text-[10px] font-semibold text-muted-foreground">1x, pra sempre</span></p></div></div></div></div><div style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><div class="relative w-full rounded-3xl p-[2px] bg-gradient-to-br from-accent via-accent/45 to-accent/15 shadow-[0_14px_44px_-14px_hsl(var(--accent)/0.55)]"><div class="relative rounded-[calc(1.5rem-2px)] bg-white px-4 pt-5 pb-4 overflow-hidden text-center"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-14 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-60 h-28 rounded-full" style="filter: blur(28px);"></div><span class="relative inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-accent text-accent-foreground text-[10px] font-bold tracking-widest mb-3">ACESSO VITALÍCIO</span><div class="relative font-bold text-[15px] leading-tight mb-2">Pague 1x. Seu pra sempre.</div><div class="relative flex items-end justify-center gap-2"><span class="text-[42px] leading-none font-extrabold tracking-tight text-accent">R$ 27,90</span></div><div class="relative text-[12px] font-semibold text-muted-foreground mt-1.5">pagamento único no Pix</div><div class="relative text-[12.5px] leading-snug mt-2.5" data-testid="nao-e-mensal"><strong>Não é mensal, não é anual.</strong> Nenhuma cobrança depois — nunca.</div><div class="relative grid grid-cols-3 gap-1.5 mt-3.5"><span class="rounded-full bg-secondary px-1 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-bold leading-tight">16 módulos</span><span class="rounded-full bg-secondary px-1 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-bold leading-tight">Sem mensalidade</span><span class="rounded-full bg-secondary px-1 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-bold leading-tight">Garantia 7 dias</span></div></div></div></div><div style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-4 text-left" data-testid="confiavel"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-foreground text-left "><span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block w-1.5 h-4 rounded-[3px] shrink-0" style="background: rgb(31, 157, 106);"></span>É confiável?</div><div class="mt-3 space-y-3"><div class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="grid place-items-center w-8 h-8 rounded-[10px] bg-secondary shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-smartphone w-4 h-4 text-foreground/80"><rect width="14" height="20" x="5" y="2" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M12 18h.01"></path></svg></span><div class="text-[13px] leading-snug"><strong>É o mesmo app das lojas.</strong><br><span class="text-muted-foreground">Publicado na App Store e no Google Play — entra com o e-mail da compra.</span></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="grid place-items-center w-8 h-8 rounded-[10px] bg-secondary shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-zap w-4 h-4 text-foreground/80"><path d="M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z"></path></svg></span><div class="text-[13px] leading-snug"><strong>Pix confirmado = acesso na hora.</strong><br><span class="text-muted-foreground">Liberação automática, sem esperar ninguém.</span></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="grid place-items-center w-8 h-8 rounded-[10px] bg-secondary shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-message-circle w-4 h-4 text-foreground/80"><path d="M7.9 20A9 9 0 1 0 4 16.1L2 22Z"></path></svg></span><div class="text-[13px] leading-snug"><strong>Suporte dentro do app e por e-mail.</strong><br><span class="text-muted-foreground">suporte@coreaplicativo.com.br — gente de verdade respondendo.</span></div></div></div><div class="relative mt-5 mx-1 mb-1"><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -top-2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 rotate-2 w-[70px] h-4 rounded-[2px]"></span><div class="rounded-md px-3.5 py-3 text-[13px] leading-snug text-left -rotate-1 shadow-[0_8px_20px_-14px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)]" style="background: rgb(255, 243, 176); color: rgb(38, 38, 38);"><strong>Garantia de 7 dias.</strong> Não curtiu? Manda 1 mensagem e o valor volta. Sem perguntas.</div></div></div></div><div style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><div class="text-left rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-4" data-testid="mural"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-foreground text-left mb-3"><span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block w-1.5 h-4 rounded-[3px] shrink-0" style="background: rgb(242, 178, 51);"></span>O que dizem na Google Play</div><div class="space-y-2.5"><div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-4 text-left"><div class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><span class="grid place-items-center w-10 h-10 rounded-full text-[14px] font-bold text-white shrink-0" style="background: rgb(228, 87, 46);">N</span><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2"><span class="text-[13px] font-bold leading-tight truncate">Natalia J.</span><span class="text-[11px] text-[#f0a500] tracking-tight shrink-0" aria-label="5 estrelas">★★★★★</span></div><div class="text-[11px] text-muted-foreground leading-tight">Avaliação na Google Play · ago/2026</div></div></div><p class="text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed text-foreground/90 mt-2.5">gostei muito do app, consegui organizar minhas finanças, vi meus gastos e pedi ajuda com a ia TMB</p></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-4 text-left"><div class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><span class="grid place-items-center w-10 h-10 rounded-full text-[14px] font-bold text-white shrink-0" style="background: rgb(18, 122, 86);">P</span><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2"><span class="text-[13px] font-bold leading-tight truncate">Paulo P.</span><span class="text-[11px] text-[#f0a500] tracking-tight shrink-0" aria-label="5 estrelas">★★★★★</span></div><div class="text-[11px] text-muted-foreground leading-tight">Avaliação na Google Play · ago/2026</div></div></div><p class="text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed text-foreground/90 mt-2.5">aplicativo muito bom, vale o preço, depois que baixei, organizei minha rotina, e estou ganhando mais por causa disso, e passando mais tempo com a minha família</p></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-4 text-left"><div class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><span class="grid place-items-center w-10 h-10 rounded-full text-[14px] font-bold text-white shrink-0" style="background: rgb(210, 45, 128);">E</span><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2"><span class="text-[13px] font-bold leading-tight truncate">Elisa D.</span><span class="text-[11px] text-[#f0a500] tracking-tight shrink-0" aria-label="5 estrelas">★★★★★</span></div><div class="text-[11px] text-muted-foreground leading-tight">Avaliação na Google Play · ago/2026</div></div></div><p class="text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed text-foregr